DESCRIPTION<<VER_4_1_0_P0_P2
4.1.0: P0–P2 module integration — wire contract bundles into hosted core paths.

Memory (kernel/core/memory/): fl_stack free-frame pool for PMM; fl_exec_context with
heap/stack/instruction-pointer/register snapshot; fl_result_t on fallible PMM APIs.

Time (kernel/core/time/): fl_timekeeping uses POSIX time.h (CLOCK_MONOTONIC) per P1-7.

Identity (kernel/core/identity/): JSON accounts (username, password, is_elevated) in
users.lab.json — default flinstone/flinstone (normal) and root/root (elevated).
login switches account; elevated accounts need no sudo for protected ops.

Jail (P0 FS surface): sudo or elevated login escapes VM jail (full drive access);
requires_elevation paths still gated unless privileged.

Authz (P2-3): fm_service gates; sudo [reason] grants elevation; sudo useradd/userdel/passwd
manage accounts (persisted JSON).

Tests: test_p0_p2_wiring (stack, PMM, exec context, user db, path props, timekeeping).
VER_4_1_0_P0_P2

RELEASE_DATE=2026-05-21
